&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote — United States (Open to applicants located anywhere in the United States.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fueled is a leading digital strategy, design, and engineering agency. We are a 300+ person team that has designed and built hundreds of digital products and experiences for brands like Google, Apple, The New York Times, ESPN, Victoria’s Secret, MGM Resorts, Albertsons, and CLEAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;SEO &amp;amp; Analytics Strategist &lt;/strong&gt;at Fueled, you will be part of Fueled’s Digital Growth Strategy team, helping our clients implement actionable strategies that positively impact and measure their business goals and desired audience outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re motivated by solving complex problems and helping clients find the right path forward through data-driven solutions and practical, easy-to-understand insights. You look beyond surface metrics to uncover what truly drives discovery, engagement, and conversion, and turn those findings into measurable impact. In this role, you’ll contribute to a mix of enterprise-level projects and ongoing engagements that continue to sharpen your skills, working with a diverse client base that includes innovative startups, nonprofits, and global organizations across media, technology, healthcare, and mission-driven sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intentionally remote, our team thrives in a culture that values flexibility, creativity, and cutting-edge technology. Together, we’re shaping the future of digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive long-term discoverability and growth by shaping SEO and AI search (GEO/AIO) strategies that expand brand visibility across traditional search and AI-driven answer engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen digital foundations by translating technical, content, and structured data insights into prioritized optimization roadmaps that improve site authority and machine readability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence how brands appear in AI and search ecosystems by guiding entity, content, and trust-signal enhancements that improve citation, attribution, and accuracy in AI-generated results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect strategy to business impact by designing measurement frameworks and experimentation approaches that tie search and content performance to client goals and revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional growth initiatives by partnering with clients and delivery teams to turn insights into scalable recommendations that extend beyond a single project or channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will achieve:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurably increase qualified organic and AI-driven visibility, traffic, and engagement across client digital properties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver optimization roadmaps that result in sustained improvements to crawlability, indexation, structured data coverage, and AI readability scores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how client brands and content are surfaced and cited in AI-generated experiences and search features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear, trusted measurement models that connect search and content efforts to conversion and revenue impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce repeatable, insight-led growth wins through testing and experimentation that inform broader client strategy and future engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring strong, hands-on experience in SEO, audience growth, and analytics, and use that foundation to turn search and performance insights into practical, high-impact actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to use leading SEO and audit tools and, more importantly, translate findings into clear, prioritized recommendations that teams can realistically implement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how AI and LLM-driven search works and apply that knowledge to improve discoverability beyond traditional SERPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re confident with analytics and tracking frameworks, using GA4, GTM, and visualization tools to produce insights that guide decisions and prove impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate and communicate effectively, seeking cross-team input and explaining complex technical ideas in clear, concise language to any audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Contractor Fee&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation is determined based on a variety of factors including relevant experience, projects, geographic location, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Contractor Pool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed as a contract position, offering you the opportunity to experience our team and culture while showcasing your contributions. When the fit and business needs align, some contractors are invited to explore a transition into full-time roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about Fueled’s mission and think you have what it takes to be successful in this role, even if you don’t check all the boxes – please apply. We’d appreciate the opportunity to review your application. Everyone gets a response.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upon meeting the necessary criteria, you’ll join the Fueled contractor network, granting you access to project invitations tailored to your expertise and availability when they arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any data provided will be processed in accordance with applicable law and our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fueled.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;. Curious about what to expect during our talent process? Check it out&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/1d84dccd9d8b80f8a0b0d40b244f4caf?pvs=21&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote — Anywhere&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;(Open to applicants located anywhere around the globe.)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fueled is a leading digital strategy, design, and engineering agency. We are a 300+ person team that has designed and built hundreds of digital products and experiences for brands like Google, Apple, The New York Times, ESPN, Victoria’s Secret, MGM Resorts, Albertsons, and CLEAR.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Contract Senior Web Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;at Fueled, your mission is to architect the foundational systems that power dynamic, large-scale digital experiences. You will define the technical backbone of our projects, leveraging deep WordPress expertise to build robust, scalable solutions with modern PHP and sophisticated Gutenberg architecture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work bridges critical business needs and elegant technical execution, ensuring the platforms you build are performant, maintainable, and capable of evolving with our clients&#39; ambitions. By setting a high bar for back-end craftsmanship and mentoring through your code, you&#39;ll leave a lasting imprint on our products, our team, and the millions of users who interact with your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Intentionally remote, our team thrives in a culture that values flexibility, creativity, and cutting-edge technology. Together, we’re shaping the future of digital experiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;build the core of enterprise-level WordPress solutions,&amp;nbsp;developing high-performance plugins and themes with modern PHP and sophisticated Gutenberg blocks in React.js.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the back-end technical vision and strategy for large-scale projects,&amp;nbsp;making critical decisions on architecture, performance, and scalability that set the stage for long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate the entire team&#39;s output&amp;nbsp;by providing expert code reviews that champion code quality, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve complex performance and caching challenges,&amp;nbsp;transforming slow, brittle systems into fast, resilient platforms that can handle millions of visitors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your work will become the foundation upon which our clients build,&amp;nbsp;creating the tools and systems that power digital experiences for a global audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will achieve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Within your first month,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll have taken ownership of a significant back-end feature or system, shipping code that demonstrates your architectural expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;By the 3-month mark,&amp;nbsp;a performance or caching improvement you championed will have resulted in a measurable increase in site speed or stability for a client project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your technical guidance will have directly shaped a project&#39;s strategy,&amp;nbsp;with your architectural recommendations being implemented and praised by both the team and the client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have established a new pattern or best practice&amp;nbsp;for WordPress development that has been adopted by other engineers, elevating the team&#39;s collective output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;By the end of your contract,&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll leave behind a legacy of robust, well-architected systems that continue to perform at scale and a standing invitation for future collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;deep&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;passion for pushing WordPress to its limits,&amp;nbsp;with expert-level mastery in modern PHP and a sophisticated understanding of the Gutenberg ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your GitHub is a testament to your craft, filled with real-world WordPress code that demonstrates your ability to build elegant, scalable solutions&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;no whiteboard tests needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strategic partner and communicator,&amp;nbsp;comfortable leading technical discussions with clients and translating their business needs into a powerful technical vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a master of the back-end development lifecycle,&amp;nbsp;with extensive Git workflow experience and a proven ability to expertly debug and optimize complex systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive on a distributed team,&amp;nbsp;proactively collaborating and leading from the remote location of your choice to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Contractor fee&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation is determined based on a variety of factors, including relevant experience, projects, geographic location, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Contractor Pool&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This role is designed as a contract position, offering you the opportunity to experience our team and culture while showcasing your contributions. When the fit and business needs align, some contractors are invited to explore a transition into full-time roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;If you are passionate about Fueled&#39;s mission and think you have what it takes to be successful in this role, even if you don&#39;t check all the boxes - please apply. We&#39;d appreciate the opportunity to review your application. Everyone gets a response.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Upon meeting the necessary criteria, you&#39;ll join the Fueled contractor network, granting you access to project invitations tailored to your expertise and availability when they arise.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;Any data provided will be processed in accordance with applicable law and our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://fueled.com/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://fueled.com/privacy-policy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;. Curious about what to expect during our talent process? Check it out&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--focus-visible&quot; href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/fueled/What-to-Expect-from-the-Interview-Process-at-Fueled-1d84dccd9d8b80f8a0b0d40b244f4caf?pvs=4&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.notion.so/fueled/What-to-Expect-from-the-Interview-Process-at-Fueled-1d84dccd9d8b80f8a0b0d40b244f4caf?pvs=4&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We don&#39;t want you to miss any communication from us! To ensure you receive updates on your application, please add jobs@fueled.com to your contacts list! #LI-Remote&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote — Americas Team (Open to applicants located in North &amp;amp; South America, with the ability to primarily work within US business hours/time zones)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fueled is a leading digital strategy, design, and engineering agency. We are a 300+ person team that has designed and built hundreds of digital products and experiences for brands like Google, Apple, The New York Times, ESPN, Victoria’s Secret, MGM Resorts, Albertsons, and CLEAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; at Fueled, you will contribute to solving complex product challenges and shaping them into clear, high-value solutions, particularly within content-rich, CMS-driven environments. You will work closely with teammates and clients alike, helping shape experiences that ship, scale, and support structured content across digital products. This role is for a strong individual contributor who brings a thoughtful point of view, collaborative partnership, and attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intentionally remote, our team thrives in a culture that values flexibility, creativity, and cutting-edge technology. Together, we’re shaping the future of digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end experiences for content-rich, editorial, and information-heavy web and mobile products, often within CMS-driven and structured content environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and contribute to design systems and reusable patterns that support flexible content structures, ensuring scalability, consistency, polish, and long-term quality across projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with internal cross-discipline teams, contributing to solutions that align product, engineering, and strategy toward cohesive outcomes, while exploring innovative approaches and challenging assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support workshops and presentations as a key design contributor, building trust and credibility through clear storytelling, thoughtful communication, and demonstration of design impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use motion and interaction design strategically to enhance clarity, guide user attention, and reinforce experiences in ways that communicate intent and craftsmanship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will achieve:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver design experiences that users trust and teams can scale, turning insight into intuitive solutions across flows, screens, and interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring clarity to complex, ambiguous challenges, helping teams and clients move forward with confidence and reduced friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen cross-functional alignment, contributing to shared understanding and measurable progress across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build client confidence through thoughtful design contributions, clear communication, and well-presented ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance the quality and consistency of design work across projects, using design systems, motion, and interaction to elevate outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About you:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of experience in visual, product, or digital design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity, exploring complex challenges with curiosity and turning them into clear, value-driven product experiences, particularly within content-heavy or CMS-driven environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited by storytelling and strategy, articulating design decisions clearly and confidently to clients and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams, contributing to alignment through thoughtful communication and shared problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a high level of care and attention to detail to your work, with pride for design quality, visual craft, interaction, and motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Contractor Fee&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation is determined based on a variety of factors including relevant experience, projects, geographic location, and business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our Contractor Pool&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about Fueled&#39;s mission and think you have what it takes to be successful in this role, please apply. We&#39;d appreciate the opportunity to review your application. Everyone gets a response.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upon meeting the necessary criteria, you&#39;ll join the Fueled contractor network, granting you access to project invitations tailored to your expertise and availability when they arise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any data provided will be processed in accordance with applicable law and our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://fueled.com/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;. Curious about what to expect during our talent process? Check it out&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/fueled/What-to-Expect-from-the-Interview-Process-at-Fueled-1d84dccd9d8b80f8a0b0d40b244f4caf?pvs=4&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t want you to miss any communication from us! To ensure you receive updates on your application, please add&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;mailto:jobs@fueled.com&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-814683658&quot;&gt;jobs@fueled.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to your contacts list!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote – Americas (Open to applicants located in North American aligned time zones)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fueled is a leading digital strategy, design, and engineering agency. We are a 300+ person team that has designed and built hundreds of digital products and experiences for brands like Google, Apple, The New York Times, ESPN, Victoria’s Secret, MGM Resorts, Albertsons, and CLEAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Content Designer&lt;/strong&gt; at Fueled, you’ll bring clarity to complex product experiences through thoughtful, strategic content design. You’ll partner closely with design, product, and engineering teams to shape content systems that scale by moving beyond copy to define structure, meaning, and user understanding across digital products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intentionally remote, our team thrives in a culture that values flexibility, creativity, and cutting-edge technology. Together, we’re shaping the future of digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead content design across client engagements, shaping clear, user-centered experiences through content strategy, UX writing, and information architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous product and business goals into structured content models, messaging frameworks, and scalable content systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and adapt content to meet client needs, balancing brand voice, user experience, and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product designers, engineers, and stakeholders to integrate content seamlessly into the product development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and deliver key content artifacts (e.g., audits, taxonomies, content models, voice and tone guidelines) while facilitating workshops to align teams on strategy and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will achieve:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver content systems and experiences that improve clarity, usability, and overall product effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create scalable content foundations that support long-term product growth and consistency across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams move from ambiguity to clarity by structuring content in ways that enable confident design and engineering decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen collaboration across disciplines by integrating content design into product thinking from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar for content design craft across projects, contributing to thoughtful, strategic, and user-centered outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 4+ years in content design, UX writing, or content strategy, ideally within an agency environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in fast-paced, multi-client settings and are comfortable navigating ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring a strategic approach to content, with experience in content modeling, IA, and structured content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced working with CMS platforms, shaping how content is structured and managed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong collaborator and communicator, able to align teams and clearly articulate content decisions to clients and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
