&lt;p&gt;Fueled is a leading digital strategy, design, and engineering agency. We are a 300+ person team that has designed and built hundreds of digital products and experiences for brands like Google, Apple, The New York Times, ESPN, Victoria&#39;s Secret, MGM Resorts, Albertsons, and CLEAR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Product Growth Strategist &lt;/strong&gt;at Fueled, you&#39;ll help leading organizations identify opportunities to improve user acquisition, activation, engagement, retention, and long-term customer value. Working alongside Product Managers, Designers, Engineers, and executive stakeholders, you&#39;ll translate data into actionable insights that shape product decisions and create measurable business outcomes. You&#39;ll partner with globally recognized brands to solve complex product challenges through experimentation, behavioral analytics, and strategic consulting. Whether you&#39;re helping launch a new digital experience, improve onboarding, increase feature adoption, or optimize retention, your work will directly influence products used by millions of people around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intentionally remote, our team thrives in a culture that values flexibility, creativity, and cutting-edge technology. Together, we&#39;re shaping the future of digital experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pe54zn&quot; data-start=&quot;331&quot; data-end=&quot;493&quot;&gt;Develop and execute Product Growth strategies that improve acquisition, activation, engagement, retention, and long-term customer value across digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;t7c6s5&quot; data-start=&quot;494&quot; data-end=&quot;634&quot;&gt;Analyze behavioral and product analytics to identify growth opportunities, prioritize experiments, and make data-informed recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nxumq7&quot; data-start=&quot;635&quot; data-end=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Lead experimentation initiatives, including hypothesis development, A/B testing, measurement frameworks, and performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1954uss&quot; data-start=&quot;769&quot; data-end=&quot;917&quot;&gt;Partner with Product, Design, Engineering, Marketing, and client stakeholders to align growth initiatives with business objectives and user needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19sy5vw&quot; data-start=&quot;918&quot; data-end=&quot;1055&quot;&gt;Present strategic recommendations to clients, translating complex data into actionable insights that drive measurable product outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will achieve:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn &amp;amp; implement Fueled&#39;s growth methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; During your first several weeks, you&#39;ll immerse yourself in Fueled&#39;s product growth frameworks, build relationships across disciplines, and gain a deep understanding of our consulting approach and client engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead strategic growth initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; As you ramp up, you&#39;ll independently own product growth engagements, partnering directly with clients to identify opportunities, prioritize initiatives, and deliver measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive data-informed product decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Through thoughtful analysis, experimentation, and customer insight, you&#39;ll help clients improve product adoption, user engagement, retention, and overall product performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver meaningful business outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work will directly contribute to stronger digital products, better customer experiences, and measurable growth for some of the world&#39;s most recognized brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About you:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tl9gt7&quot; data-start=&quot;1077&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;You have experience developing Product Growth strategies for digital products and using behavioral analytics to drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fpepco&quot; data-start=&quot;1216&quot; data-end=&quot;1381&quot;&gt;You are proficient with behavioral analytics platforms such as Mixpanel, Amplitude, GA4, or similar tools, and have experience designing or evaluating experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xepv41&quot; data-start=&quot;1382&quot; data-end=&quot;1513&quot;&gt;You understand customer journeys, product metrics, and experimentation across acquisition, activation, engagement, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hvcv8w&quot; data-start=&quot;1514&quot; data-end=&quot;1650&quot;&gt;You enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams, communicating recommendations to clients, and solving complex product challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18k4el5&quot; data-start=&quot;1651&quot; data-end=&quot;1815&quot;&gt;You thrive in a remote, consulting environment where you can manage multiple client engagements, take ownership, and adapt quickly to new products and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
