&lt;h3&gt;About &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 8,000 companies — from scrappy startups to global brands — use our platform to send billions of emails, push notifications, in-app messages, and SMS every day. &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt; powers automated communication that people actually want to receive. We help teams send smarter, more relevant messages using real-time behavioral data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&#39;m Matt Lane, Manager of Account Management at &lt;a href=&quot;http://Customer.io&quot;&gt;Customer.io&lt;/a&gt;, and I&#39;m looking for a Senior Account Manager to join our EMEA team. This is a revenue ownership role — you&#39;ll manage a portfolio of mid-market and enterprise accounts, driving renewals, identifying expansion opportunities, and building the kind of relationships that make customers want to grow with us. You&#39;ll be part of a tight-knit EMEA team and a key commercial voice for the accounts you own.&lt;/p&gt;
