&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Invisible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible Technologies makes AI work. Our end-to-end AI platform structures messy data, automates digital workflows, deploys agentic solutions, measures outcomes, and integrates human expertise where it matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform cleans, labels, and structures company data so it is ready for AI. It adapts models to each business and adds human expertise when needed, the same approach we have used to improve models for more than 80% of the world’s top AI companies, including Microsoft, AWS, and Cohere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our successes span industries, from supply chain automation for Swiss Gear to AI-enabled naval simulations with SAIC, and validating NBA draft picks for the Charlotte Hornets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Profitable for more than half a decade, Invisible reached $134M in revenue and ranked as the number two fastest growing AI company on the 2024 Inc. 5000. In September 2025, we raised $100M in growth capital to accelerate our mission of making AI actually work in the enterprise and to advance our platform technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Enterprise Solutions Manager is a key operational leader driving our most complex and high-stakes enterprise delivery. Moving beyond standard process management, this role operates at the intersection of strategic problem-solving, technical project management, and high-velocity operations. We are looking for an exceptional, high-rigor operator who can take deeply ambiguous enterprise challenges, structure them, and lead cross-functional execution to deliver scalable AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the end-to-end operational delivery of our most strategic, multi-faceted enterprise engagements, serving as the critical link between our commercial team, executive clients, and internal engineering teams. Operating with the analytical rigor and structuring capability of a top-tier Engagement Manager or Tech BizOps Leader, you will partner directly with technical leadership to build 0-to-1 operational processes and ensure world-class delivery. Furthermore, you will serve as a multiplier for the team, mentoring other Enterprise Solutions Managers and advising senior client leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Commercial &amp;amp; Engineering Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the critical bridge between go-to-market and delivery on marquee accounts. Partner with the commercial team to deeply understand complex client requirements and business objectives, working in lockstep with engineering to deliver the execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&quot;Two-in-a-Box&quot; Strategic Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner directly with the account&#39;s Technical Lead to drive outcomes on our most complex, highest-value engagements. While they own the technical architecture and solution design, you act as their operational counterpart to ensure flawless execution, resource alignment, and risk mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Complex Enterprise Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Ceremonies:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the end-to-end operational execution of massive enterprise AI deployments across multiple concurrent workstreams. Oversee and optimize agile technical delivery ceremonies (e.g., cross-functional stand-ups, sprint planning, complex Jira backlog grooming) to ensure engineering execution maps precisely to commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Client Advisory:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate, support and if required, lead requirement scoping and key strategic meetings alongside account and tech leadership. Act as a trusted advisor to senior client stakeholders (VP and C-Suite), moving beyond standard status updates to provide actionable, data-driven insights on engagement progress and operational ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as the Operational Backbone:&lt;/strong&gt; Take highly ambiguous client problems and structure them into clear, actionable delivery frameworks. Design, implement, and scale 0-to-1 operational processes for new, bespoke use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantitative Problem Solving &amp;amp; Strategic Business Cases: &lt;/strong&gt;Build highly rigorous, assumption-driven, and fact-based business cases to drive executive-level decision-making. Establish real-time analytics, define KPIs, and lead continuous performance analysis to ensure exceptional quality and workflow optimization at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a coach and mentor to other Enterprise Solutions Managers. Guide and upskill operational staff and internal delivery teams, fostering a culture of rigorous problem-solving, extreme ownership, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Profile (5–8+ Years Experience):&lt;/strong&gt; High-rigor analytical and operational leadership experience from top-tier management consulting (e.g., MBB Engagement Manager, Big 4 Manager/Senior Manager) or a high-growth tech environment (e.g., Senior BizOps, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, or Strategic Delivery).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Client-Facing Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong executive presence and a proven ability to lead complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise accounts, directly advising and influencing C-level and VP-level leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship &amp;amp; Capacity Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience mentoring junior team members, upskilling operational talent, and building high-performing delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zero-to-One Operations at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of building complex operations, delivery frameworks, and scalable processes from scratch for multi-million dollar enterprise programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience gathering requirements from commercial or go-to-market teams and working tightly alongside technical leadership and engineers to execute on software, automation, or AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to break down massive, highly ambiguous projects into actionable workstreams and execute them with relentless precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong bias toward action, absolute ownership mentality, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, highly ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$207,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Offers will also include bonus + equity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find more information about our geographic pay tiers &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; During the interview process, your Invisible Talent Acquisition Partner will confirm which tier applies to your location. For candidates outside the U.S., compensation is adjusted to reflect local market conditions and cost of living.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bonuses and equity are included in all offers. Final compensation is determined by a combination of factors, including location, job-related experience, skills, knowledge, internal pay equity, and overall market conditions. Because of this, every offer is unique. Additional details on total compensation and benefits will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
