&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role: equal parts AI engineer, software builder, and technical consultant. It&#39;s perfect for someone who wants to be hands-on with models and close to the impact they generate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
