&lt;li&gt;Build shared infrastructure, reusable components, and internal playbooks to level-up the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and mentor mid-level engineers and help shape the culture of forward-deployed AI engineering at Invisible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
