&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*As part of our standard hiring process, we would like to inform you that a background check may be conducted at the final stage of recruitment through our third-party provider, Checkr.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Please note that Cast AI &lt;/em&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;em&gt;does not&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;em&gt; provide any form of visa sponsorship/work permit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Cast AI?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cast AI is the leading Application Performance Automation (APA®) platform, helping organizations automate cloud operations at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By embedding autonomous decision-making directly into Kubernetes and AI infrastructure, Cast AI continuously optimizes performance, reliability, and efficiency - eliminating the need for manual infrastructure management. More than 2,100 organizations, including Akamai, BMW, Cisco, FICO, Hugging Face, NielsenIQ, Swisscom, and TGS, trust Cast AI to power their cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a global company operating across 34 countries, backed by world-class investors, and in 2026 became a unicorn. We&#39;re building the future of autonomous cloud operations - and we&#39;re looking for exceptional people who want to help shape what&#39;s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of Cast AI&#39;s most important growth opportunities will not emerge from existing functions or traditional go-to-market motions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They will come through strategic partnerships, new business models, and executive relationships that cut across Product, Engineering, Sales, Marketing, Partnerships, and executive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These opportunities often begin as an executive relationship or promising idea but lack a clear owner, business proposition, and execution plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Strategic Business Development, you will close that gap by identifying and prioritizing a focused portfolio of high-potential strategic opportunities, developing senior external relationships, turning ideas into compelling commercial propositions, negotiating and launching new initiatives, and transitioning validated programs to their long-term operating owners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own each opportunity from initial development through commercial definition and early execution. Once a program has a validated proposition, clear economics, a repeatable operating model, and a long-term owner, responsibility should transfer rather than remain permanently with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a day-to-day partner management role, a BDR or pipeline generation role, a corporate development or M&amp;amp;A position, or a Chief of Staff role. It is a hands-on business-building role with meaningful external accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success will be measured by the strategic and economic value you create—not the number of meetings, introductions, signed memoranda, or partnership announcements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Cast AI leadership at selected industry conferences, executive forums, partner meetings, and other strategic external engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish relationships with senior business, product, and technology executives across the cloud and AI ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities that expand Cast AI&#39;s market access, strengthen its product position, create new routes to market, or unlock new revenue potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate initial conversations into clear customer propositions, commercial models, and strategic business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate opportunities based on strategic fit, customer value, economic potential, technical feasibility, required investment, time to impact, and probability of execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the strategic business development process through agreement, coordinating with Legal, Finance, Product, Engineering, Sales, Marketing, and Partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incubate new strategic programs by building cross-functional launch plans, coordinating product integrations, joint solution development, pilots, co-selling initiatives, and market activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve cross-functional barriers, maintain momentum through the ambiguous early stages, and assess whether initiatives are creating sufficient customer and economic value to justify further investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transition validated programs to permanent operating owners by documenting the proposition, economics, operating model, governance, and key external relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 10-15+ years of experience in Strategic Business Development, Partnerships, Alliances, Enterprise Technology, or an adjacent commercial leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful experience in cloud infrastructure, AI, developer tools, enterprise software, or another technically sophisticated B2B ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success originating, structuring, negotiating, launching - and where appropriate, ending - strategic relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with C-suite, product, technology, and commercial executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, including business-case development and partnership economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sufficient technical fluency to engage credibly with Product and Engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience aligning multiple internal functions and external counterparties within a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently perform the analysis, relationship development, negotiation, and program-building work without relying on a large team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with the credibility to represent Cast AI independently in high-stakes external settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel globally (approximately 30–50%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Particularly attractive backgrounds include senior partner-development or alliances roles at a hyperscaler, strategic business development roles at AI or AI infrastructure companies, or comparable roles within high-growth infrastructure software businesses. Experience at both a large technology platform and a growth-stage company is especially valuable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build one of the most strategic roles at one of the fastest-growing infrastructure software companies in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with Cast AI&#39;s executive leadership on high-impact initiatives that shape the company&#39;s future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with some of the most influential organizations across the global cloud and AI ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
