&lt;li&gt;Own the competitive assets, narrative, and proof points Sales and Customer Success use with customers, backed by win/loss analysis of what&#39;s actually winning and losing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the feedback loop from customer and market signal back into roadmap input.&lt;/li&gt;
