&lt;li&gt;Clear English communication, collaborative and self-directed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias toward action and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What would make you stand out&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
